ers as a condition of human life.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الخناسر is glossed الخناسر الضعاف من الناس, “the weak among people,” while ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ names a human being or humankind. The weak are part of humankind, so خُسْرٍ recasts the human group through frailty.\"}"}}
